[00:07.74] Many tears ago you said you love me, oh
[00:16.48] How happy was this heart of mine
[00:22.64] Then a dark cloud came from out of nowhere
[00:30.02] And the sun went down no more to shine.
[00:37.96] Many tears ago I learned too well love
[00:44.44] What it means to bear a heavy load
[00:51.02] I found out just what has meant by sorrow
[00:58.96] Many tears ago along life's road.
